{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-96-1","title":"Psalms 96:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to praise God, 4 for his greatness; 8 for his kingdom; 11 for his general judgment.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2962. B.C. 1042. O sing. 33:3; 98:1; 149:1; 1Ch 16:23-33; Re 5:9; 14:3 sing unto. 67:3-6; 68:32; Ro 15:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-2","title":"Psalms 96:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>bless. 72:17,18; 103:1,2,20-22; 104:1; 145:1,10; 1Ch 29:20; Eph 1:3 Re 5:13 shew. 40:10; 71:15; Isa 40:9; 52:7,8; Mr 16:15; Ac 13:26; Ro 10:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-3","title":"Psalms 96:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>22:27; 72:18,19; 117:1,2; Isa 19:23-25; 49:6; Da 4:1-3; 6:26,27 Mic 4:2; Zec 9:10; Mt 28:19; Lu 24:47; Re 14:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-4","title":"Psalms 96:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>For the. 18:3; 86:10; 89:7; 145:3; Ex 18:11; 1Sa 4:8; Ne 9:5 and greatly. 18:3 he is. 66:3,5; 76:7; 89:7; 95:3; Jer 5:22; 10:6,7; Lu 12:5; Re 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-5","title":"Psalms 96:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For. 115:3-8; 135:15,18; Isa 44:8-28; 46:1,2; Jer 10:3-5,11,12,14,15 Ac 19:26; 1Co 8:4 but. 115:15; Ge 1:1; Isa 42:5; Jer 10:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-6","title":"Psalms 96:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Honour. 8:1; 19:1; 63:2,3; 93:1; 104:1; Heb 1:3; 2Pe 1:16,17 strength. 27:4; 29:1,2,9; 50:2 sanctuary. 1Ch 16:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-7","title":"Psalms 96:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Give. 29:1,2; 68:32-34; Lu 2:14; Jude 1:25 O ye kindreds. 22:27; 66:1,2; 67:3,4; Ro 15:9,10; Re 5:9; 19:6 glory. 1Ch 29:11-13; Mt 6:13; 1Pe 5:11; Jude 1:24,25; Re 5:13; 7:12; 14:7 Re 19:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-8","title":"Psalms 96:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the glory. 108:3-5; 111:9; 148:13,14; Ex 34:5-9; Re 15:4 due unto. Heb. of. bring. Isa 60:6,7; Mal 1:11; Ro 12:1; 15:16; Php 2:17; 4:18 Heb 13:13,15,16; 1Pe 2:5; Re 8:3,4 come. 100:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-9","title":"Psalms 96:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>in the beauty of holiness. or, in the glorious sanctuary. 29:2; 110:3; Ezr 7:27; Eze 7:20; Da 11:45; Lu 21:5,6 fear. 33:8; 76:7,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-10","title":"Psalms 96:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Say. 18:49; 46:6,10; 126:2; Mal 1:11,14; Ga 1:16 the Lord. 2:8-12; 59:13; 93:1; 97:1; 99:1; Da 2:44; Mt 3:2; Re 11:15; 19:6 the world. Isa 49:8; Col 2:7; Heb 1:3 judge. 13; 9:8; 67:4; 98:9; Isa 11:3-5; Ac 17:31; Ro 2:5,6; 3:5,6; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-11","title":"Psalms 96:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the heavens. 69:34; 148:1-4; Isa 44:23; 49:13; Lu 2:10,13,14; 15:10; Re 12:12 Re 19:1-7 the sea. 98:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-12","title":"Psalms 96:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>65:12,13; Isa 42:10,11; 55:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-96-13","title":"Psalms 96:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":96,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":96,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he cometh. 98:9; Isa 25:8,9; Mal 3:1,2; 1Th 4:16-18; 2Th 1:10; 2Ti 4:8 Tit 2:13; 2Pe 3:12-14; Re 11:18; 22:10 judge. 10; 67:4; Re 19:11</p>"}]}